{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/wplpku","slide":5,"text":"我把 Memory 分为 Session、Task State 和 Business Facts 三层。Session 管跨轮上下文，Task State 管当前任务与待补充信息，Mongo 与业务服务保存甘特、工单和库存等事实。Context Compiler 只保留高价值摘要并生成稳定 hash。策略和落库通过 HITL，模型或 Tool 失败时走规则回退、重试或人工升级。\n\n[Sources]\n- D:/Desktop/metaforge/src/metaforge/orchestrator/session.py\n- D:/Desktop/metaforge/src/metaforge/memory/manager.py\n- D:/Desktop/metaforge/src/metaforge/memory/boundary.py\n- D:/Desktop/metaforge/src/metaforge/memory/pending.py\n- D:/Desktop/metaforge/src/metaforge/strategy/context_builder.py\n- D:/Desktop/metaforge/src/metaforge/services/persist_store.py\n- D:/Desktop/metaforge/src/metaforge/strategy/hitl.py"}
